01:53:42.800 --> 01:53:45.960
o

01:54:16.520 --> 01:54:18.840
I used to come here with him often.

01:54:19.690 --> 01:54:21.620
This is where we walked on our dates.

01:54:22.250 --> 01:54:24.120
Oh, I see.

01:54:24.740 --> 01:54:26.580
During the spring after his accident…

01:54:27.400 --> 01:54:29.290
At the place filled with our memories…

01:54:29.290 --> 01:54:31.300
I sang his favorite song.

01:54:31.770 --> 01:54:34.170
That was ''Amazing Grace'', wasn't it?

01:54:35.060 --> 01:54:35.670
Yeah.

01:54:36.720 --> 01:54:37.640
As for me…

01:54:38.320 --> 01:54:41.240
At first I really resented those four people…

01:54:42.190 --> 01:54:44.740
To the point that I wanted to kill them.

01:54:45.590 --> 01:54:47.570
But, I forgave them…

01:54:48.690 --> 01:54:52.530
Because ''Amazing Grace'' is a song of forgiveness.

01:54:55.360 --> 01:54:56.870
Well, I'm off.

01:54:57.640 --> 01:54:59.660
Conan-kun, let's sing in harmony again sometime.

01:55:03.140 --> 01:55:03.760
See you.

01:55:04.790 --> 01:55:05.490
Goodbye.

01:55:06.530 --> 01:55:07.420
Goodbye.

01:55:10.840 --> 01:55:12.360
By the way, Ran-neechan…

01:55:12.940 --> 01:55:16.170
How did you know Shinichi-niichan was the one playing then?

01:55:18.330 --> 01:55:20.840
That's because he has a weird habit when he plays.

01:55:20.840 --> 01:55:22.140
I could tell immediately.

01:55:24.030 --> 01:55:24.850
Is that so?

01:55:32.230 --> 01:55:35.260
What's this ''weird habit''?
